      "q": "Is KIIT approved by UGC and AICTE?",
      "a": "Yes. KIIT is UGC recognized and its B.Tech programs follow AICTE norms."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I get B.Tech admission without JEE?",
      "a": "Yes. Admission is possible through direct admission or university-level entrance tests, subject to seat availability."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is B.Tech possible with 45–50% marks in 10+2?",
      "a": "Yes. Eligible students may be considered under direct or management quota."
    },
    {
